The film stars Gerard Butler (who is also a producer) and features a supporting cast that includes Ali Fazal, Navid Negahban, Bahador
Foladi, Nina Toussaint-White, Tom Rhys Harries, Vassilis Koukalani, Mark Arnold, Corey Johnson, and Travis Fimmel.

12
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
Loosely based on actual events, the story follows a CIA operative and his
translator who flee Afghanistan after their covert mission is exposed.

13
